{"ready":true,"data":{"id":"terry-notary","name":"Terry Notary","birthDate":"1968-08-14","birthPlace":"San Rafael, California, USA","bio":"Terry Notary (born August 14, 1968) is an American actor, stunt coordinator/double and movement coach. Notary mainly portrays creatures and animals for the film and television industry, and is known for his motion capture performances in films, including Avatar, The Adventures of Tintin: Secrets of the Unicorn, the Planet of the Apes reboot series, The Hobbit trilogy, and Kong: Skull Island. In 2018, Notary played Cull Obsidian in the Marvel Studios films Avengers: Infinity War and Avengers: Endgame.\n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Terry Notary, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia.","source":"TMDB","fetchedAt":"2026-11-19T17:46:23+00:00","tmdbId":236696,"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/person/236696","credits":[{"id":"infinity-war","title":"Avengers: Infinity War","character":"Cull Obsidian / On-Set Groot"}],"photo":"./public-data/images/people/terry-notary.webp","filmography":[{"name":"The Electric State","year":2025,"character":"Mr. Peanut / Pop Fly / Sentre Drones / Ice Cream Bot / Skeeve Bot","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/sI2NiMU8o65hmIMY0JI9CjJ0p7f.jpg"},{"name":"Nope","year":2022,"character":"Gordy","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/AcKVlWaNVVVFQwro3nLXqPljcYA.jpg"},{"name":"The Call of the Wild","year":2020,"character":"Rail Worker / Live Action Reference Performance of Buck","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/33VdppGbeNxICrFUtW2WpGHvfYc.jpg"},{"name":"Avengers: Endgame","year":2019,"character":"On-Set Groot / Cull Obsidian","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/jtDv3lCnST0fZRvdYFwR5CVwK2x.jpg"},{"name":"Avengers: Infinity War","year":2018,"character":"Cull Obsidian / On-Set Groot","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/7WsyChQLEftFiDOVTGkv3